      ],
      "text": "Ulikuq spends 10 minutes to plot a course and attempts a DC 20 Sailing-lore check or DC 20 Survival check check. This check is reduced to DC 15 in an arctic environment such as the Crown of the World (DC 15 Sailing-lore check or DC 15 Survival check). On a success, the severity of environmental conditions during the journey is reduced by one step for 24 hours (two steps on a critical success). This changes moderate damage to minor damage, winds that create greater difficult terrain cause only difficult terrain, and so on."
